<title>HONG KONG: HK's Regent aims to raise a total of HK$447 mln.</title>
<headline>HK's Regent aims to raise a total of HK$447 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong investment house Regent Pacific Group Ltd said on Monday it expected to raise HK$447 million through its offering of 170.5 million shares through a Hong Kong tranche, an international tranche and a private placement.</p>
<p>The offer represents 18 percent of its enlarged share capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said earlier the Hong Kong tranche would consist of 42.63 million shares at HK$2.62 each.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWS ROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
